<section class="chap" id="screens" aria-labelledby="sc-t">
 <div class="wrap">
  <div class="head"><p class="hkick">Screens</p><h2 class="t1 rise" id="sc-t">What each person sees</h2><p class="lede fade">Alexandra works 12 to 8 today. Her phone first, then what the owner sees on the web.</p></div>
  <div class="story" id="story">
   <div class="story-grid">
    <div class="steps">
     <div class="shift" aria-hidden="true"><span class="ends a">12 PM</span><span class="bar"><i id="shiftbar"></i></span><em id="shiftNow">12:00 PM</em><span class="ends b">8 PM</span></div>
     <article class="st on" data-y="0"><span class="n">Today&nbsp;· 12:00 PM to 8:00 PM</span><h3 class="t2">Her shift comes first.</h3><p>Hours, location, clocked in or not.</p></article>
     <article class="st" data-y="-23"><span class="n">To do&nbsp;· 2</span><h3 class="t2">Two things need her answer.</h3><p>A posted schedule to review. A shift swap from a teammate.</p>
      <div class="slab phone crop-ph" aria-hidden="true"><img class="feed" src="{{ 'night-phone-long.webp' | asset_url }}" alt="" width="1170" height="3936" style="--y:-43%"></div></article>
     <article class="st" data-y="-35.7"><span class="n">Recent activity</span><h3 class="t2">The owner approved her days off.</h3><p>She sees the answer on her home screen.</p></article>
    </div>
    <div class="pin" aria-hidden="true"><div class="slab phone" id="pinPhone"><img class="feed" src="{{ 'night-phone-long.webp' | asset_url }}" alt="" width="1170" height="3936"><img class="bar" src="{{ 'night-tabbar.webp' | asset_url }}" alt="" width="900" height="162"></div></div>
   </div>
  </div>
  <div class="owner-block" id="web">
   <div class="head"><h3 class="t2 rise" id="web-t">What you see as the owner</h3><p class="lede fade">Who is on shift now. What waits for your answer. Everything else in the menu.</p></div>
   <div class="slab owner" id="owner" data-in><img src="{{ 'night-owner.webp' | asset_url }}" alt="NEVORA on the web for an owner: the menu and Today, showing 4 people on shift and nothing waiting" width="3000" height="2010" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></div>
   <p class="who"><a class="ul" href="{{ 'night-owner.webp' | asset_url }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Open the full-size screen</a>&nbsp;· Alexandra and her workplace are fictional. Screens from the NEVORA app.</p>
  </div>
 </div>
</section>

<section class="chap" id="change" aria-labelledby="change-t">
 <div class="wrap">
  <div class="head"><p class="hkick">What changes</p><h2 class="t2 rise" id="change-t">From the group chat to one place.</h2></div>
  <div class="change">
   <div><h3 class="t3">Today</h3><ul><li>Schedules by text message</li><li>Paper timesheets</li><li>Hours typed into a spreadsheet</li></ul></div>
   <div><h3 class="t3">With NEVORA</h3><ul><li>Posted in the app</li><li>A tablet and a PIN</li><li>Pay statements from approved hours</li></ul></div>
  </div>
 </div>
</section>

<section class="chap specs" id="specs" aria-labelledby="specs-t">
 <div class="wrap">
  <div class="head"><p class="hkick">Details</p><h2 class="t2 rise" id="specs-t">Built for work</h2></div>
  <dl class="spec">
   <div><dt>Works on</dt><dd>Web, phones and a shared tablet.</dd></div>
   <div><dt>Languages</dt><dd>English and Spanish, chosen by each person.</dd></div>
   <div><dt>Payroll</dt><dd>Calculated from the hours you approve. You review before it is published.</dd></div>
   <div><dt>Where data lives</dt><dd>United States, Northern Virginia. Encrypted connections, role-based access.</dd></div>
  </dl>
  <p class="fine">NEVORA calculates pay statements; it does not pay your team or file payroll taxes. You can request account deletion in the app or on the web. We aim to complete it within 30 calendar days. Details in the <a class="ul" href="{% if theme.role == 'main' %}/pages/nevora-privacy{% else %}{{ routes.root_url }}?preview_theme_id={{ theme.id }}&amp;view=velani-nevora-privacy{% endif %}">NEVORA privacy policy</a>.</p>
 </div>
</section>

<section class="chap" id="get" aria-labelledby="get-t">
 <div class="wrap">
  <div class="head"><p class="hkick">Get NEVORA</p><h2 class="t2 rise" id="get-t">How your business gets NEVORA</h2></div>
  <ol class="rail r3" data-in>
   <li data-in><i>01</i><b>Tell us about your team</b><span>People, locations, how often you pay.</span></li>
   <li data-in><i>02</i><b>We set up your workplace</b><span>Free for 30 days. Up to 30 employees.</span></li>
   <li data-in><i>03</i><b>Your team signs in</b><span>Each person gets a login, and the tablet gets its PINs.</span></li>
  </ol>
  <div class="acts fade"><a class="pill" href="{% if theme.role == 'main' %}/pages/contact?interest=nevora-demo{% else %}{{ routes.root_url }}?preview_theme_id={{ theme.id }}&amp;view=velani-contact&amp;interest=nevora-demo{% endif %}">Request free trial</a><a class="pill line" href="{% if theme.role == 'main' %}/pages/plans{% else %}{{ routes.root_url }}?preview_theme_id={{ theme.id }}&amp;view=velani-plans{% endif %}">See plans</a></div>
  <p class="hfact fade">No card required&nbsp;· No automatic charge</p>
 </div>
</section>

<section class="chap chap-follow" id="faq" aria-labelledby="faq-t">
 <div class="wrap">
  <div class="qa">
  <div class="head"><p class="hkick">Questions</p><h2 class="t2 rise" id="faq-t">Questions businesses ask</h2></div>
  <div class="faq faq-list">
   <details><summary>Can my business start using NEVORA now?<svg class="icon" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 256 256" fill="currentColor"><path d="M224,128a8,8,0,0,1-8,8H136v80a8,8,0,0,1-16,0V136H40a8,8,0,0,1,0-16h80V40a8,8,0,0,1,16,0v80h80A8,8,0,0,1,224,128Z"/></svg></summary><p>Yes. Request the free trial and we set up your workplace.</p></details>
   <details><summary>Does NEVORA pay my employees or file payroll taxes?<svg class="icon" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 256 256" fill="currentColor"><path d="M224,128a8,8,0,0,1-8,8H136v80a8,8,0,0,1-16,0V136H40a8,8,0,0,1,0-16h80V40a8,8,0,0,1,16,0v80h80A8,8,0,0,1,224,128Z"/></svg></summary><p>No. NEVORA calculates payroll from approved hours and publishes pay statements. You pay your team and file taxes as you do today.</p></details>
   <details><summary>How much does NEVORA cost?<svg class="icon" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 256 256" fill="currentColor"><path d="M224,128a8,8,0,0,1-8,8H136v80a8,8,0,0,1-16,0V136H40a8,8,0,0,1,0-16h80V40a8,8,0,0,1,16,0v80h80A8,8,0,0,1,224,128Z"/></svg></summary><p>After the free 30 days, one price per business, quoted for your number of employees, your business and the features you use. See <a href="{% if theme.role == 'main' %}/pages/plans{% else %}{{ routes.root_url }}?preview_theme_id={{ theme.id }}&amp;view=velani-plans{% endif %}">Plans</a>.</p></details>
   <details><summary>I use NEVORA at work. How do I get an account?<svg class="icon" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 256 256" fill="currentColor"><path d="M224,128a8,8,0,0,1-8,8H136v80a8,8,0,0,1-16,0V136H40a8,8,0,0,1,0-16h80V40a8,8,0,0,1,16,0v80h80A8,8,0,0,1,224,128Z"/></svg></summary><p>Ask your manager; accounts come from your workplace. Still stuck? <a href="mailto:support@thevelani.com">support@thevelani.com</a>.</p></details>
  </div>
  </div>
 </div>
</section>

